#undef NDEBUG
// Review HO: transition systems and log skeletons keyed by objects equal as
// dict keys but printed apart (0.0 and -0.0, 1 and 1.0, 1 and True).
//
// - /api/mine's transition system on an upload's log shape and on its
//   dataframe shape: pm4py's set of states hashes a state by str() of its
//   name, so a window's equal objects printed apart make states of their
//   own, and each step's source and target are the last equal state the set
//   iterates (CPython's set order of the names' str hashes).
// - /api/mine's log skeleton and conformance on the log shape, on the
//   dataframe and lazyframe shapes, and /api/discover-constraints': each
//   relation names its pairs by the first pair its own pass meets; a
//   trace's never_together deviations name the trace's objects when the
//   model's pairs of its activities are not fewer than the trace's pairs;
//   a NaN or NaT class of one object seen more often than the traces
//   holding it keeps its never_together self pair.
//
// Expected values are pm4py 2.7.22 black-box on the same inputs
// (review-harness round-ho: tc/mkho.py, ct/tsv.py, ct/lsdev.py, ct/lsfdev.py).
//
// Usage: minera_server_review_ho_tests <minera_server>
// Usage: minera_server_review_hn_tests <minera_server>
